      ("Is a dermal piercing permanent?", "It is best thought of as semi-permanent. Many last for years, but dermals have a higher chance of rejection than most other piercings."),
      ("Can I change my dermal top?", "Yes, once healed. Most anchors are internally threaded, and it is wise to have your piercer do the first change so the anchor is not disturbed."),
      ("Can I get a dermal behind my ear?", "Yes, behind the ear is a popular spot. Be mindful of glasses, masks and hair, which can snag the top while it heals."),
      ("How is a dermal removed?", "A professional piercer removes it, usually with gentle pressure and massage. Never try to remove an anchor yourself."),
